        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Mary Skelter: Locked Up in Love - Blood High",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "A spin-off that was included as a Japan only pre-order bonus for Mary Skelter 2 on the Playstation 4. It was also included in Mary Skelter: Finale's \"Adventure Mode\".\n\nSet in a private high school called Blood High, many students with strange abilities study and enjoy their youth at the school. The spooky Jail Tower looms over the school grounds. There are rumors that if a couple confesses to each other under the Tower, they will be bound forever and ascend to the top.\n\nThe story begins with Jack, who has a surprise birthday party coming up that he has to pretend he doesn't know about and choose a girl to confess to under the Jail Tower.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Una historia derivada que se incluyó como bonificación de reserva exclusiva de Japón para Mary Skelter 2 en PlayStation 4. También se incluyó en el \"Modo Aventura\" de Mary Skelter Finale.\n\nSe ambienta en un instituto privado llamado Blood High, donde muchos estudiantes con habilidades extrañas estudian y disfrutan de su juventud. La siniestra Torre de la Prisión se alza sobre los terrenos del colegio. Corre el rumor de que, si una pareja se confiesa su amor bajo la Torre, quedarán unidos para siempre y ascenderán a la cima.\n\nLa historia comienza con Jack, que tiene una fiesta sorpresa de cumpleaños a la que debe fingir que no sabe nada, y debe elegir a una chica para confesarle su amor bajo la Torre de la Prisión.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2020",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
